  unitName: Zedus the Great
  unitId: 840148
  unitNumber: 8473
  description: Zedus was the first of the demigods, birthed from a ravaging thunderstorm.
    The old gods had created him, among others, for the utopian land they sought
    to populate with lesser beings in their image.
  summonDesc: Hail, Summoner!<br>I am Zedus, leader of the demigods!<br>Join me,
    and we shall achieve greatness together!
  fusionDesc: Divine strength thunders within me!<br>All of our enemies shall tremble
    before our radiance!
  evoDesc: Under my lead, Athensphere<br>shall shine like a thousand suns, and prosper
    forevermore.
